{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Sun Cleric: Solemn Priest doubles the Gavel of Light heal, Arbiter of Light does not",
  "contract": "Solemn Priest 804269: 'Increases your melee attack power by $s1% of your Intellect and causes Gavel of Light to heal you for an additional $s2% of its damage dealt.' ($s2 = 50). Gavel of Light 800611 copies a share of its damage to the caster as 707522; the share is 707521 effect 0 (50) plus Solemn Priest effect 1 (50) while the caster has 804269 (Sun Cleric ADR 0004). Each arm casts one Gavel of Light, learns its spells, casts again, and reads the second heal as a ratio of the first: every hit is a critical strike (fixture 984954) with +20000 attack power, so one hit matches the next to within about 1%, and 707522 cannot crit. Control arm: nothing learned, ratio 1. Solemn Priest: ratio 2 (100% against 50%). Arbiter of Light 302914 (a passive SPELLMOD_EFFECT1 +100 on 707521 whose tooltip gates it on Vow of Light) leaves the heal unchanged, alone (ratio 1) and with Solemn Priest (ratio 2); a share read with the caster's spell modifiers would give 3 and 4. Bands of 0.15 around each ratio.",
